  "limitations": [
    "One H2 board and Linux host; other chips, adapters and operating systems require separate validation.",
    "Repeated unchanged-image timings include esptool skipping unchanged sectors, not a full transfer benchmark.",
    "Power-loss recovery, unplugging during a write, and Gateway termination during a write were not induced on hardware.",
    "NVS is not byte-identical: normal Iris startup updates the esp_iris/crash_loop key. Other active NVS entries and listed data regions were preserved.",
    "Firmware fixtures use a 2 MB layout on the 4 MB device; the upper 2 MB was read back unchanged.",
    "Early startup logs were missing in the saved captures: UART first capture starts at esp_image segment 3 (166 ms); USB Serial/JTAG misses boot logs and application heartbeat=0. Zero Iris log_dropped_bytes does not imply lossless startup capture."
  ],
